	"data": "Concept: Community-First Adoption Strategy\n\nWhat It Is\n\nThe thesis: the success of Cyberspace/ThoughtBubbles depends less on ideas or individual implementation skill, and more on attracting and fostering a community of experts, developers, and users. The system needs to reach a demonstration point where the experience speaks for itself, and the architecture serves as the hook for technical contributors.\n\nCore Strategy\n\nThree-Layer Funnel\n\nLayer 1 — The Experience (end users)\nMultiple small,…",
